<title>USA: Alexandria, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Alexandria, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it won $2.740 million of Alexandria, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.047 percent.</p>
</text>
